(F5 T2 V5b: dof_element_dof (manual Professional 6.409, print only) of a
 quad4 with materi_velocity, materi_displacement, materi_strain_total,
 materi_stress, materi_plasti_kappa and condif_temperature, default
 global_element_dof_apply. Expected record (scripts/build_safe.sh):
 -no for velx vely disx disy temp, -yes for the 6 total strains, the 6
 stresses and kap. Source: Professional 02-08-2026 probe f5/v5b a_def (same
 input, same dof_label order).)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_strain_total
materi_stress
materi_plasti_kappa
condif_temperature
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 0 1
node 4 1 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 3 4
group_type 0 -materi -condif
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1000.
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.3
group_condif_density 0 1.
group_condif_capacity 0 1.
group_condif_conductivity 0 1.
bounda_dof 0 1 -velx -vely -temp
bounda_dof 2 2 -velx -vely
bounda_dof 3 3 -velx -vely -temp
bounda_dof 1 4 -velx
bounda_time 1 0.01
bounda_dof 4 2 -temp
bounda_time 4 10.

control_timestep 0 1. 1.
end_data
